    {
      "id": "p00000",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 1,
      "text_preview": "姚秦天竺三藏鳩摩羅什譯",
      "char_count": 11,
      "section_type": "译者署名",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00001",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 2,
      "text_preview": "觀世音菩薩行深般若波羅蜜時，照見五陰空，度一切苦厄。",
      "char_count": 26,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00002",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 3,
      "text_preview": "「舍利弗！色空故無惱壞相，受空故無受相，想空故無知相，行空故無作相，識空故無覺相。何以故？舍利弗！非色異空，非空異色。色即是空，空即是色。受、想、行、識亦如是。",
      "char_count": 80,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p203"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00003",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 4,
      "text_preview": "「舍利弗！是諸法空相，不生不滅，不垢不淨，不增不減。是空法，非過去、非未來、非現在。是故空中無色，無受、想、行、識，無眼、耳、鼻、舌、身、意，無色、聲、香、味、",
      "char_count": 128,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p203"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00004",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 5,
      "text_preview": "「以無所得故，菩薩依般若波羅蜜故，心無罣礙。無罣礙故，無有恐怖，離一切顛倒夢想苦惱，究竟涅槃。三世諸佛依般若波羅蜜故，得阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。",
      "char_count": 70,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": [
        "c008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00005",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 6,
      "text_preview": "「故知般若波羅蜜是大明呪、無上明呪、無等等明呪，能除一切苦，真實不虛。故說般若波羅蜜呪。」",
      "char_count": 45,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00006",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 7,
      "text_preview": "即說呪曰：",
      "char_count": 5,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00007",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 8,
      "text_preview": "「竭帝　竭帝　波羅竭帝　波羅僧竭帝　菩提僧莎呵」",
      "char_count": 24,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    }
